This is an independent reader for the MBI file format. It does not use, link to,
embed, or redistribute the MOBILion MBI SDK or any part of it.

Provenance of the format description:

- The container layout (HDF5 group and dataset structure, the run-length encoding
  of the sparse frame planes) was determined by inspecting public data files
  released under CC0 1.0 Universal — MassIVE MSV000099577 / PXD069856 — with
  standard HDF5 tooling. No vendor software was involved in that inspection.

- The mass-calibration parameters (`slope`, `intercept`, `mz_residual_terms`) are
  stored as plain JSON in the data files themselves, and the form of the
  calibration is described in the vendor's own publicly distributed C++ header
  files (MBICalibration.h), which document the traditional TOF fit and the
  polynomial residual correction.

